      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The Prospecti statue turns suddenly, causing its robes, which flow like fabric despite being as hard as stone, to swing about and damage opponents.\n\nCreatures adjacent to the animated statue take 2d6+6 bludgeoning damage (DC 25 basic Reflex save save; on a critical failure, the creature is also knocked Prone)."
